{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"ALSA-2026:53848","published":"2026-08-11T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-08-12T11:45:03.049268511Z","related":["CVE-2026-55995"],"summary":"Important: isns-utils security update","details":"The iSNS package contains the daemon and tools to setup a iSNS server, and iSNS client tools. The Internet Storage Name Service (iSNS) protocol allows automated discovery, management and configuration of iSCSI and Fibre Channel devices (using iFCP gateways) on a TCP/IP network.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * open-isns: open-iscsi: Denial of Service via double-free in iSNS attribute decoder (CVE-2026-55995)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"isns-utils","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/isns-utils"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"0.99-1.el8_10.1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux8/ALSA-2026:53848.json"}},{"package":{"name":"isns-utils-devel","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/isns-utils-devel"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"0.99-1.el8_10.1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux8/ALSA-2026:53848.json"}},{"package":{"name":"isns-utils-libs","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/isns-utils-libs"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"0.99-1.el8_10.1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux8/ALSA-2026:53848.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:53848"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-55995"},{"type":"REPOR